Z||000000||spiz||12-15-1999||10:19 PM||||this is my first time posting so just want to say hello to everyone first. i am swapping a v6 from 85 gt auto donor into 88 coupe 5 speed. i have been reading the threads on this swap and have gained valuable info. thanks to all. but i am still confused about the ecms. i assume i will need to use the ecm from the 85 gt but i understand that may not work with the 88 manual trans. will i need an ecm from a manual trans car? thanks for the help.||||reg||5
Z||000001||TOM||12-15-1999||10:43 PM||||The ECM is V6 orL4 specific as well as trans specific. You will need a V6 manual one.||||reg||1
